      "lpJoinBeta": "Join beta",
      "lpNonprofitLive": "A nonprofit. Live now.",
      "lpHeroH1": "You already know<br>who's <span style=\"color:#b983ff\">next.</span>",
      "lpHeroSub": "Local music is broken — pay-to-play discovery, tickets marked up 30%+, artists who never see who actually showed up. Fans are the fix. Every hype you cast, every ticket you buy direct, every friend you bring — that's what keeps the scene alive. <strong style=\"color:#f0ebe5\">iHYPE just makes it count.</strong>",
      "lpJoinFanFree": "Join as a fan — free →",
      "lpNoCard": "No card. No catch. 30 seconds.",
      "lpArtistInstead": "Artist, DJ, or venue instead?",
      "lpWhatYouDoEyebrow": "What you actually do here",
      "lpWhatYouDoH2": "Three small things. One big difference for the scene.",
      "lpThing1H": "Hype who deserves it",
      "lpThing1P": "Your HYPE is a real vote, not a like. When you back an artist early, venues and other fans actually see it — that's how someone gets discovered instead of paying to be seen.",
      "lpThing2H": "Buy the ticket, direct",
      "lpThing2P": "Face value, no scalper markup. Buying direct is what actually pays the artist 70% and the room 20% — not a platform fee that never reaches either of them.",
      "lpThing3H": "Bring someone with you",
      "lpThing3P": "Share a show with your link. If a ticket sells because you spread the word, you earn a real cut of the 10% promoter pool — never the artist's share.",
      "lpArtistsWritep": "Artists write the songs. DJs spin the sets. Venues open the doors. <strong style=\"color:#b983ff\">None of it happens without fans showing up first.</strong> That's the part you play.",
      "lpReadyH2": "Ready to be part of the scene?",
      "lpReadySub": "Free forever, for everyone — fans, artists, DJs, and venues alike.",
